    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's also worth noting that our has experience with budget reduction scenarios, where our can absorb up to 10 percent reductions via rate renegotiation with subcontractors or implement scope reductions for larger cuts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information about the project specific requirements and costs, I cannot provide a precise projection of our projected margin on this contract or tailor-made cost-optimization strategies for the client. our current financial position indicates our have a credit line available of 300,000 euros and a cash position of 520,000 euros, which could support the initial phases of the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, to accurately assess the projected margin on this contract and propose detailed cost-saving measures, more specific data about the project scope, timeline, and required resources would be necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents, with a high level of relevance of the answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI technologies and innovations would you propose to meet these performance requirements, and how would you ensure the explicability and transparency of the solution's recommendations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the performance requirements of providing times of response compatible with daily use by agents, a high level of relevance of answers, and an objective of availability of 99.9%, you propose leveraging our expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We can deploy We preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which has shown strong performance in French-language tasks and is self-hostable, ensuring data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve the required response times, our can utilize quantization methods such as INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ) to optimize the model's inference speed while maintaining acceptable accuracy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure a high level of relevance in the answers, We RAG capabilities can be employed, which include dense vector retrieval and hybrid strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable the model's to retrieve relevant information from internal procedures and applicable regulations, providing accurate and context-specific responses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability and transparency, we can implement Explainable AI (XAI) methods such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, and SHAP for classification models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explainable AI (XAI) methods such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, and SHAP for classification models will provide insights into the decision-making process of the model's, allowing agents to understand the reasoning behind the recommendations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can utilize our experience with confidence scoring to detect when the model's is uncertain or lacks confidence in the model's response." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In such cases, the system can be designed to display an uncertainty warning and escalate the query to a human supervisor for review, ensuring that agents are not misled by potentially incorrect information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve the availability objective of 99.9%, our can design a robust and fault-tolerant architecture, leveraging our experience with deploying AI models in production environments. design will include implementing redundancy, load balancing, and monitoring systems to ensure the solution remains operational and responsive at all times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI technologies and innovations, we can develop a solution that meets the performance requirements while providing explicability and transparency, ultimately supporting the agents in the agents daily activities and enhancing the overall efficiency of the administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information, with a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What CSR and sustainability strategies would you propose to meet these requirements, and how would you measure and report on our company's environmental performance?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., you can propose several strategies to meet these requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's can leverage our company's green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy and have a low power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would enable our company's to reduce the carbon footprint of our company's data centers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's can implement digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices are expected to reduce energy consumption by around 35% compared to our company's baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To measure and report on our company's environmental performance, our company's can utilize our company's carbon reporting capability, which is based on the GRI Standards (partial). our company's can also conduct regular bilan carbone assessments, similar to the one our company's conducted in 2023, to track our company's total scope 1 and 2 greenhouse gas emissions. our company's current total scope 1 and 2 emissions are 148 tCO2e. our company's aim to achieve net zero by 2040 and are working towards obtaining ISO 14001 certification by 2026. our company's currently have an Ecovadis rating of Silver with a score of 62." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these strategies and tracking our company's progress, our company's can contribute to reducing the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information while also improving our company's own sustainability performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "**Executive Summary** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Eurocloud Solutions S.A., Lexia GmbH, and Greencompute S.r.l., proposes a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in the City of Belval's municipal agents daily missions. proposes aligns with the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy, aiming to improve administrative services' efficiency and quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will design, implement, and deploy an intelligent assistance tool, integrating with existing systems and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, particularly GDPR, EU AI Act, and SecNumCloud standards. **Understanding of Requirements** the City of Belval's requires an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in accessing information, drafting documents, and processing files. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in accessing information, drafting documents, and processing files must integrate with existing systems, ensure data sovereignty, and comply with regulatory requirements. the City of Belval's has a budget of 3 million euros over 4 years and expects a high level of availability (99.9%) and performance. **Proposed Solution** Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposed solution, based on the expertise of Nexus Engineering S.r.l. consortium partners, includes: 1. **Technical Architecture**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will design a cloud-based architecture using Outscale, a SecNumCloud-compliant provider, ensuring data sovereignty and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technical stack includes Docker, Kubernetes, and Helm for deployment and management. 2. **Artificial Intelligence**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement a Large Language Model (LLM) powered by Mistral 7B Instruct, with hosting options on Outscale, a SecNumCloud-compliant provider or other compliant providers. a Large Language Model (LLM) powered by Mistral 7B Instruct will utilize quantization methods (int8, int4) and techniques (GPTQ) for optimized performance. 3. **API Integration**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will develop APIs using REST, GraphQL, and SOAP protocols to integrate with existing systems, including civil status software, town planning software, EDM, and user directories. 4. **Security and Compliance**: a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in their daily missions will comply with GDPR, EU AI Act, and SecNumCloud standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement access control measures, including multi-factor authentication (TOTP, FIDO2), and utilize encryption and anonymization methods for data protection. 5. **Cost Management**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposed contract is a fixed-price contract with a target gross margin percentage of 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will provide detailed cost estimates, including labor, infrastructure, and other expenses. **Technical Details** * **Deployment**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will deploy a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in their daily missions on Outscale, a SecNumCloud-compliant provider, ensuring compliance with SecNumCloud standards. * **API Standards**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will use REST, GraphQL, and SOAP protocols for API integration. * **Data Protection**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize encryption (e.g., Microsoft Presidio) and anonymization methods (e.g., custom NER models) for data protection. * **Access Control**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement multi-factor authentication (TOTP, FIDO2) and role-based access control. **Regulatory Compliance** a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in their daily missions will comply with the following regulations: * **GDPR**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will ensure compliance with GDPR requirements, including data hosting in the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union, and protection of sensitive data. * **EU AI Act**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will comply with EU AI Act requirements for transparency, explainability, and human oversight. * **SecNumCloud**: a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in their daily missions will meet SecNumCloud standards for cloud security. **Costs** Nexus Engineering S.r.l. estimated costs for the project are: * **Total Budget**: 3 million euros over 4 years * **Annual Cost**: approximately 750,000 euros per year * **Target Gross Margin Percentage**: 28% **Conclusion** Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Eurocloud Solutions S.A., Lexia GmbH, and Greencompute S.r.l., is confident that a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in their daily missions will meet the City of Belval's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool. a comprehensive artificial intelligence solution to assist the City of Belval's municipal agents in their daily missions ensures compliance with regulatory requirements, integrates with existing systems, and provides a high level of availability and performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. look forward to the opportunity to discuss Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposal in further detail. **Unaddressed Requirements** None of the requirements from the tender were left unaddressed by the agents' answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
